{:edb/db-before-t 503 :edb/db-after-t 504 :edb/tx-data [[13194139533816 50 #inst "2026-10-05T03:25:08.206Z" 13194139533816 true] [17592186115108 1020 #edb/ref 17592186253239 13194139533816 true] [17592186115108 1020 #edb/ref 17592186253243 13194139533816 true] [17592186115109 1020 #edb/ref 17592186253246 13194139533816 true] [17592186115110 1020 #edb/ref 17592186253250 13194139533816 true] [17592186115445 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533816 true] [17592186115445 1145 "First, we calculate the derivative using the sum rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(11\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+\\frac{1}{x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(11\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+{x}^{-1}) \\\\  & =11(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)-\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =-11\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute $x=\\sqrt{3}$ in the derivative and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(\\sqrt{3}) & =-11\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{3})-\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\sqrt{3})\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\sqrt{3})-\\frac{1}{(\\sqrt{3})^{2}} \\\\  & =-11\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{3})-\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\sqrt{3})\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\sqrt{3})-\\frac{1}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533816 true] [17592186253239 1017 #edb/ref 17592186253240 13194139533816 true] [17592186253239 1089 "q-340597" 13194139533816 true] [17592186253239 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533816 true] [17592186253239 1100 "Find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ if $y=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x)\\operatorname{cot}⁡(x).$\n\n$\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=$\n{{field-1}} $-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x){csc}^{2}⁡(x)$" 13194139533816 true] [17592186253239 1113 #uuid "82740349-bfa0-5913-911f-c267c09d2564" 13194139533816 true] [17592186253239 1145 "We calculate the derivative using the product rule, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}\\,(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x)\\operatorname{cot}⁡(x)) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{x}\\cdot \\operatorname{cot}⁡(x)+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x)(-{csc}^{2}⁡(x)) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cot}⁡(x)}{x}-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x){csc}^{2}⁡(x)\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533816 true] [17592186253240 1000 #edb/ref 17592186253241 13194139533816 true] [17592186253240 1000 #edb/ref 17592186253242 13194139533816 true] [17592186253240 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533816 true] [17592186253240 1041 "field-1" 13194139533816 true] [17592186253240 1104 #edb/ref 17592186253241 13194139533816 true] [17592186253240 1110 #uuid "83938fdb-db25-5c80-90c2-ddb9b4cf74b4" 13194139533816 true] [17592186253241 1034 "\\frac{\\cot(x)}{x}" 13194139533816 true] [17592186253241 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533816 true] [17592186253241 1111 #uuid "8e32c7b0-d847-59b5-aff1-affd9a0d520b" 13194139533816 true] [17592186253242 1034 "\\cot(x)" 13194139533816 true] [17592186253242 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533816 true] [17592186253242 1111 #uuid "6d712dac-64a8-5447-a94c-6b07820135e0" 13194139533816 true] [17592186253243 1017 #edb/ref 17592186253244 13194139533816 true] [17592186253243 1089 "q-340598" 13194139533816 true] [17592186253243 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533816 true] [17592186253243 1100 "Find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ if $y=x\\operatorname{cot}⁡(x).$\n\n$\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{cot}⁡(x)\\,-$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533816 true] [17592186253243 1113 #uuid "bd7b9a8e-cad8-598c-9c66-6deb13873f47" 13194139533816 true] [17592186253243 1145 "We calculate the derivative using the product rule, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x\\operatorname{cot}⁡(x)) \\\\  & =1\\operatorname{cot}⁡(x)+x(-{csc}^{2}⁡(x)) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cot}⁡(x)-x{csc}^{2}⁡(x)\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533816 true] [17592186253244 1000 #edb/ref 17592186253245 1